<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr\/guncel","name":"G\u00dcNCEL"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr\/ozgur-ozelden-zeytin-ureticisine-destek-cagrisi","name":"\u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel\u2019den zeytin \u00fcreticisine destek \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"\u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel\u2019den zeytin \u00fcreticisine destek \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131","articleSection":"G\u00dcNCEL","dateCreated":"2026-10-31T13:49:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-31T13:49:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-31T13:49:00+03:00","wordCount":2113,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr\/ozgur-ozelden-zeytin-ureticisine-destek-cagrisi"},"articleBody":"YEN\u0130 Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel, 31 Ekim 2026\u2019da Bal\u0131kesir\u2019in Edremit il\u00e7esindeki Zeytinli K\u00f6y Meydan\u0131\u2019nda zeytin \u00fcreticileriyle bir araya geldi. Kad\u0131n \u00fcreticilerin a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kta oldu\u011fu bulu\u015fmada \u00e7ift\u00e7iler, artan girdi maliyetleri, d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck al\u0131m fiyatlar\u0131, i\u015f\u00e7ilik giderleri ve sosyal g\u00fcvence eksikli\u011fi gibi sorunlar\u0131n\u0131 anlatt\u0131.\r\n\r\n\u00dcreticilerin taleplerini dinleyen \u00d6zel, zeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in do\u011frudan destek, al\u0131m garantisi ve \u00fcreticinin gelirini g\u00fcvence alt\u0131na alacak politikalar \u00f6nerdi. \u00d6zel, dane zeytine 20 lira, zeytinya\u011f\u0131na ise 50 lira ilave do\u011frudan destek verilmesini istedi.\r\n\r\n\u00dcreticiler artan maliyetlerden yak\u0131nd\u0131\r\n\r\nZeytinli K\u00f6y Meydan\u0131\u2019nda \u00fcreticilerle sohbet eden \u00d6zel, bulu\u015fman\u0131n amac\u0131n\u0131n zeytin \u00fcreticilerinin sorunlar\u0131n\u0131 dinlemek ve bu sorunlar\u0131 kamuoyuna duyurmak oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi. Toplant\u0131n\u0131n kad\u0131n zeytin \u00fcreticileriyle sohbet amac\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten \u00d6zel, kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n yo\u011fun oldu\u011funu ifade etti.\r\n\r\nG\u00fcls\u00fcm isimli \u00fcretici, zeytin toplama ve i\u015f\u00e7ilik maliyetlerinin sat\u0131\u015f gelirini a\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirterek, bir g\u00fcnl\u00fck i\u015f\u00e7i yevmiyesinin 1.500 liraya ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, bir \u00e7uval zeytinin ise 300 liraya sat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. \u00dcreticinin maliyetinin 6 bin liray\u0131 buldu\u011funu dile getiren G\u00fcls\u00fcm, zeytincili\u011fin \u00e7ok zor durumda oldu\u011funu anlatt\u0131.\r\n\r\nZeynep isimli \u00fcretici de mazot fiyat\u0131n\u0131n 100 liraya \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, bu nedenle o\u011flunun 30 d\u00f6n\u00fcm bu\u011fday ekemedi\u011fini belirtti. Tarlan\u0131n s\u00fcr\u00fclmesinin 5 bin liraya mal oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yleyen \u00fcretici, y\u00fcksek maliyetler nedeniyle \u00e7ift\u00e7inin \u00fcretim yapmakta zorland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade etti.\r\n\r\nBir ba\u015fka kad\u0131n \u00fcretici, zeytincilikle ge\u00e7inen ailelerin gelirlerinin geriledi\u011fini, \u00e7ocuklar\u0131na har\u00e7l\u0131k veremez duruma geldiklerini s\u00f6yledi. TAR\u0130\u015e\u2019in fiyat a\u00e7\u0131klamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten \u00fcretici, i\u015f\u00e7i bulmakta ya\u015fanan g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fck nedeniyle baz\u0131 ailelerin zeytin hasad\u0131n\u0131 kendi imk\u00e2nlar\u0131yla yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 aktard\u0131.\r\n\r\nP\u0131narba\u015f\u0131 K\u00f6y\u00fc\u2019nden gelen bir \u00fcretici ise zeytinlerin dal\u0131nda kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, ge\u00e7im s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 ya\u015fad\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 ve temel ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lamakta zorland\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 dile getirdi. Bir ba\u015fka kad\u0131n \u00fcretici de i\u015f\u00e7ilerin g\u00fcnl\u00fck kazan\u00e7lar\u0131yla temel market ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131 dahi kar\u015f\u0131layamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, zeytinlerin tarlada kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nKad\u0131n \u00fcreticiler sosyal g\u00fcvence istedi\r\n\r\nToplant\u0131da kad\u0131nlar\u0131n tar\u0131msal \u00fcretimdeki eme\u011fi ve sosyal g\u00fcvence sorunu da g\u00fcndeme geldi. Bir kad\u0131n \u00fcretici, y\u0131l\u0131n 12 ay\u0131 zeytin i\u015finde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 ancak sigorta ve sosyal g\u00fcvenceye sahip olmad\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 belirtti.\r\n\r\nD\u00f6rt ku\u015fakt\u0131r zeytincilik yapt\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 anlatan erkek bir \u00fcretici ise ge\u00e7mi\u015fte zeytincilikle ailelerin ge\u00e7indirilebildi\u011fini, bug\u00fcn ise kazanc\u0131n g\u00fcnl\u00fck ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lamaya yetmedi\u011fini s\u00f6yledi. Ge\u00e7en y\u0131l 50 lira olan zeytinin bu y\u0131l 20-25 liradan al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten \u00fcretici, g\u00fcbre maliyetlerinin de y\u00fckseldi\u011fini ifade etti.\r\n\r\n\u00dcretici, \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcn\u00fc toplat\u0131p satt\u0131ktan sonra i\u015f\u00e7i paras\u0131n\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131layamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, cebinden para eklemek zorunda kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. TAR\u0130\u015e\u2019in piyasada etkili olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savunan \u00fcretici, k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck \u00fcreticinin giderek zorland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 dile getirdi.\r\n\r\nHayvanc\u0131l\u0131kla u\u011fra\u015fan Mustafa Sal\u0131 da s\u00fct fiyatlar\u0131n\u0131n ve yem maliyetlerinin \u00fcreticiyi zorlad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtti. Mand\u0131rada s\u00fct\u00fcn 23 liradan al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, yem firmalar\u0131n\u0131n ise her hafta zam yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yleyen Sal\u0131; \u015fap hastal\u0131\u011f\u0131, et ithalat\u0131 ve \u00fcretimde d\u0131\u015fa ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k konular\u0131na dikkat \u00e7ekti.\r\n\r\nSolako\u011flu: Temel sorun al\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n fiyat belirlemesi\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti\u2019nin tar\u0131m politikalar\u0131ndan sorumlu ismi Sencer Solako\u011flu, zeytin \u00fcreticilerinin ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 sorunlar\u0131n yaln\u0131zca bu y\u0131la \u00f6zg\u00fc olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, yap\u0131sal bir problem bulundu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u0130ktidara gelmeleri durumunda al\u0131m garantisi getireceklerini belirten Solako\u011flu, \u00fcretimin art\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131n hem \u00fcretici hem de t\u00fcketici a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan yararl\u0131 olaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savundu. \u00dcretim miktar\u0131 y\u00fckseldi\u011finde birim fiyatlar\u0131n d\u00fc\u015febilece\u011fini ancak toplam has\u0131lat\u0131n artabilece\u011fini ifade etti.\r\n\r\nBu\u011fday piyasas\u0131ndan \u00f6rnek veren Solako\u011flu, 16,5 lira olarak a\u00e7\u0131klanan al\u0131m fiyat\u0131na ra\u011fmen \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcn T\u00fcrkiye genelinde 12,5 liradan sat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, borsa fiyat\u0131n\u0131n ise 21 liraya \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. Bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te \u00e7ift\u00e7inin zarar etti\u011fini, t\u00fcketicinin de ekme\u011fi pahal\u0131ya ald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten Solako\u011flu, temel sorunun al\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n fiyat belirlemesi oldu\u011funu savundu.\r\n\r\n\u00d6zel: \u00dcretici \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcn\u00fc satarken g\u00fcvencesiz\r\n\r\n\u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel, zeytin \u00fcreticilerinin ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 ekonomik s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n yaln\u0131zca Edremit\u2019le s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, T\u00fcrkiye genelinde farkl\u0131 tar\u0131m \u00fcr\u00fcnlerinde de benzer sorunlar\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcld\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fc s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nZeytinli\u2019nin zeytincili\u011fin \u00f6nemli merkezlerinden biri oldu\u011funu belirten \u00d6zel, b\u00f6lgede 2 bin y\u0131ldan uzun s\u00fcredir zeytin \u00fcretildi\u011fini ifade etti. \u00d6zel, \u201cAntik \u00e7a\u011flardan beri bu topraklarda zeytin var, zeytincilik var, zeytin hasad\u0131 var. Antik \u00e7a\u011flardan beri ilk kez zeytin \u00fcreticisi bu kadar peri\u015fan durumda. Son \u00fc\u00e7 y\u0131l\u0131n, be\u015f y\u0131l\u0131n de\u011fil, bin y\u0131l\u0131n krizi, iki bin y\u0131l\u0131n krizi ile kar\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131yay\u0131z\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\n\u00dcreticilerin zeytinlerini toplatacak ve i\u015fletecek paray\u0131 bulamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yleyen \u00d6zel, sofral\u0131k zeytinin ge\u00e7en y\u0131l 90 liradan sat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, bu y\u0131l \u00fcretim maliyetinin 75 liraya ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtti. Buna kar\u015f\u0131n al\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fc 40-50 lira aras\u0131nda almaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade etti.\r\n\r\nZeytinya\u011f\u0131nda \u00fcretim maliyetinin 280 lira oldu\u011funu, sat\u0131\u015f fiyat\u0131n\u0131n ise 220 liraya ve daha a\u015fa\u011f\u0131ya geriledi\u011fini s\u00f6yleyen \u00d6zel, TAR\u0130\u015e\u2019in bu y\u0131l fiyat a\u00e7\u0131klamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve baz\u0131 \u015firketlerin piyasada fiyatlar\u0131 a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 \u00e7ekti\u011fini savundu.\r\n\r\n\u00c7ay, f\u0131nd\u0131k, Antep f\u0131st\u0131\u011f\u0131, \u00fcz\u00fcm, bu\u011fday, kay\u0131s\u0131 ve limon \u00fcreticilerinin de benzer sorunlarla kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten \u00d6zel, maliyetlerin en az y\u00fczde 50-70 artt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, bir\u00e7ok \u00fcr\u00fcnde fiyatlar\u0131n ge\u00e7en y\u0131l\u0131n yar\u0131s\u0131na geriledi\u011fini kaydetti. Tar\u0131msal planlaman\u0131n ortadan kalkt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savunan \u00d6zel, \u00fcreticinin \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcn\u00fc satma konusunda g\u00fcvencesiz oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u00dcreticiye gelir garantisi \u00f6nerisi\r\n\r\nDevletin b\u00fcy\u00fck altyap\u0131 projelerinde m\u00fcteahhitlere ge\u00e7i\u015f, yolcu ve hasta garantisi verdi\u011fini ancak tar\u0131msal \u00fcreticiye gelir g\u00fcvencesi sa\u011flamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yleyen \u00d6zel, bu durumu ele\u015ftirdi.\r\n\r\nPartisinin iktidar\u0131nda \u00fcreticilere ge\u00e7im garantisi verilece\u011fini belirten \u00d6zel, \u201cYeni Parti\u2019nin kuraca\u011f\u0131 iktidarda \u00fcreticiye ge\u00e7im garantisi olacak. Havaliman\u0131 yap\u0131yorlar, u\u00e7u\u015f garantisi var, yolcu garantisi var. T\u00fcnel yap\u0131yorlar, ge\u00e7i\u015f garantisi var. Hastanede hasta garantisi var. 20 y\u0131l, 25 y\u0131l, 30 y\u0131l s\u00f6zle\u015fmesine g\u00f6re. Ama zeytinciye geldi\u011finde ge\u00e7im garantisi yok. Yok \u00f6yle ya\u011fma. Bundan sonra kim ge\u00e7im garantisi veriyorsa oyu o alacak\u201d diye konu\u015ftu.\r\n\r\nZeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in d\u00fcnya pazar\u0131 vurgusu\r\n\r\nT\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin zeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131 ihracat\u0131ndaki konumunu de\u011ferlendiren \u00d6zel, Tunus\u2019un \u00fcretti\u011fi zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n y\u00fczde 80\u2019ini ihra\u00e7 etti\u011fini, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de ise bu oran\u0131n y\u00fczde 10 oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi. T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin \u00fcretimde birinci, ihracatta alt\u0131nc\u0131 s\u0131raya geriledi\u011fini ifade eden \u00d6zel, \u0130talya\u2019n\u0131n T\u00fcrkiye\u2019den ald\u0131\u011f\u0131 zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kendi markas\u0131yla daha y\u00fcksek fiyatla d\u00fcnya pazarlar\u0131na sundu\u011funu savundu.\r\n\r\nZeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n yaln\u0131zca ham \u00fcr\u00fcn olarak de\u011fil, marka de\u011feriyle ihra\u00e7 edilmesi gerekti\u011fini belirten \u00d6zel; ihracat ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n geli\u015ftirilmesi, kooperatiflerin desteklenmesi ve katma de\u011ferli \u00fcr\u00fcnlerin art\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u00dcreticinin al\u0131m g\u00fcc\u00fcndeki gerilemeyi mazot ve i\u015f\u00e7ilik \u00fczerinden anlatan \u00d6zel, ge\u00e7en y\u0131l bir kilogram zeytinle 1,5 litre mazot al\u0131nabilirken bu y\u0131l bir litre mazot alabilmek i\u00e7in iki kilogram zeytin sat\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini belirtti. \u00dc\u00e7 y\u0131l \u00f6nce yakla\u015f\u0131k iki kilogram zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n bir g\u00fcnl\u00fck i\u015f\u00e7i yevmiyesine denk geldi\u011fini, bug\u00fcn ise bir yevmiye i\u00e7in 10 kilogram zeytinya\u011f\u0131 sat\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini kaydetti.\r\n\r\nKad\u0131nlara sigorta ve emeklilik hakk\u0131 s\u00f6z\u00fc\r\n\r\nZeytin hasad\u0131nda kad\u0131n ve erkek i\u015f\u00e7iler aras\u0131nda yevmiye fark\u0131 uygulanmas\u0131n\u0131 ele\u015ftiren \u00d6zel, kad\u0131nlar\u0131n tar\u0131msal \u00fcretimdeki emeklerinin kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 alamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve sosyal g\u00fcvenceye eri\u015femedi\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nKad\u0131n ve erkek yevmiyeleri aras\u0131nda 200 lira fark bulundu\u011funu belirten \u00d6zel, kad\u0131nlar\u0131n istihdam, sigorta ve emeklilik haklar\u0131ndan yoksun b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade etti.\r\n\r\n\u0130ktidarlar\u0131nda \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan kad\u0131nlara prim deste\u011fi sa\u011flayacaklar\u0131n\u0131 belirten \u00d6zel, \u00fccretli \u00e7al\u0131\u015famayan, evde bak\u0131m sorumlulu\u011fu \u00fcstlenen ve ailesinin ge\u00e7imi i\u00e7in evde emek harcayan kad\u0131nlara da sosyal g\u00fcvence sunacaklar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. \u00d6zel, b\u00fct\u00fcn kad\u0131nlar\u0131n emeklilik hakk\u0131na sahip olaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade etti.\r\n\r\nErdo\u011fan-Trump ili\u015fkisi \u00fczerinden d\u0131\u015f politika ele\u015ftirisi\r\n\r\nT\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin d\u0131\u015f politikas\u0131n\u0131 da ele\u015ftiren \u00d6zel, \u00fclkeler aras\u0131ndaki ili\u015fkilerin kurumsal d\u00fczeyde y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclmesi gerekti\u011fini savundu. ABD Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Donald Trump ile Cumhurba\u015fkan\u0131 Recep Tayyip Erdo\u011fan aras\u0131ndaki ili\u015fkiye de\u011finen \u00d6zel, bu s\u00fcre\u00e7ten ABD\u2019nin kazan\u00e7l\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, Edremitli \u00fcreticinin ise yarar sa\u011flayamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ileri s\u00fcrd\u00fc.\r\n\r\nTrump ile g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme s\u00fcrecinde T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin ABD\u2019den u\u00e7ak al\u0131m\u0131, s\u0131v\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f do\u011fal gaz tedariki ve Amerikan \u00fcr\u00fcnlerine uygulanan vergilerin kald\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 gibi konularda taviz verdi\u011fini iddia eden \u00d6zel, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019den ABD\u2019ye g\u00f6nderilen zeytinya\u011f\u0131na y\u00fczde 12,5 vergi uyguland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u00d6zel, bu durumun Edremit zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n ABD pazar\u0131na giri\u015fini zorla\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirterek h\u00fck\u00fcmetin \u00fcreticinin ihracat\u0131n\u0131 kolayla\u015ft\u0131racak ad\u0131mlar atmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini savundu.\r\n\r\nDane zeytine 20, zeytinya\u011f\u0131na 50 lira destek talebi\r\n\r\n\u00d6zel, zeytin \u00fcreticilerinin i\u00e7inde bulundu\u011fu ko\u015fullara y\u00f6nelik k\u0131sa vadeli \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00f6nerisini de a\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131. Bu y\u0131l dane zeytine kilogram ba\u015f\u0131na 20 lira, zeytinya\u011f\u0131na ise kilogram ba\u015f\u0131na 50 lira do\u011frudan ilave destek verilmesini istedi. \u00d6zel, konuyu b\u00fct\u00e7e g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmelerinde Meclis g\u00fcndemine ta\u015f\u0131yacaklar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u0130ktidarlar\u0131nda zeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131 stratejik \u00fcr\u00fcnler aras\u0131na alacaklar\u0131n\u0131 belirten \u00d6zel, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de 250 milyon zeytin a\u011fac\u0131 bulundu\u011funu ifade etti. Zeytinin sa\u011fl\u0131k, ekonomi ve istihdam a\u00e7\u0131s\u0131ndan \u00f6nem ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yleyen \u00d6zel, \u00f6zellikle kad\u0131n eme\u011finin de\u011ferlendirilmesi bak\u0131m\u0131ndan sekt\u00f6r\u00fcn stratejik kabul edilmesi gerekti\u011fini kaydetti.\r\n\r\nAl\u0131m garantisi ve taban fiyat \u00f6nerisi\r\n\r\nZeytin \u00fcretiminde rekolte, stok ve ihracat rakamlar\u0131n\u0131n d\u00fczenli a\u00e7\u0131klanmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini belirten \u00d6zel, rekolte uyar\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n dikkate al\u0131nmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve gerekli tedbirlerin al\u0131nmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savundu.\r\n\r\n\u0130hracat yasaklar\u0131n\u0131n \u00fcreticinin yurt d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki pazarlar\u0131n\u0131 kaybetmesine neden oldu\u011funu ifade eden \u00d6zel, t\u00fcketiciyi koruman\u0131n yolunun \u00fcreticinin pazar\u0131n\u0131 kaybettirmek olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. \u0130hracat yasa\u011f\u0131 nedeniyle yabanc\u0131 al\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n ba\u015fka \u00fclkelerle ba\u011flant\u0131 kurdu\u011funu ve sonraki y\u0131llarda T\u00fcrkiye\u2019den al\u0131m yapmaktan ka\u00e7\u0131nabildi\u011fini belirtti.\r\n\r\nDevletin zeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131nda al\u0131m garantisi vermesini, yurt d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki al\u0131c\u0131larla d\u00fczenli ticari ba\u011flant\u0131lar kurmas\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6neren \u00d6zel; \u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fcn fazla oldu\u011fu y\u0131llarda kamu al\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n art\u0131r\u0131larak stok olu\u015fturulmas\u0131n\u0131, \u00fcretimin yetersiz oldu\u011fu d\u00f6nemlerde ise ihracat taahh\u00fctlerinin ba\u015fka kaynaklardan kar\u015f\u0131lanmas\u0131n\u0131 istedi.\r\n\r\nD\u00fcnya fiyatlar\u0131n\u0131n geriledi\u011fi d\u00f6nemlerde ihracat deste\u011fi verilmesi ve kamu al\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n art\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini de s\u00f6yleyen \u00d6zel, Avrupa Birli\u011fi ile tar\u0131m \u00fcr\u00fcnlerini de kapsayan bir G\u00fcmr\u00fck Birli\u011fi anla\u015fmas\u0131 yap\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nerdi. Bu kapsamda \u00f6zellikle \u00fcz\u00fcm, zeytin ve f\u0131nd\u0131k \u00fcr\u00fcnlerine \u00f6ncelik verilmesi gerekti\u011fini kaydetti.\r\n\r\n\u00d6zel, taban fiyat\u0131n \u00fcretim girdileri dikkate al\u0131narak belirlenmesini ve \u00fcreticinin ortalama verimde \u00fcretim yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 ko\u015fullarda zarar etmemesini sa\u011flayacak bir al\u0131m garantisi olu\u015fturulmas\u0131n\u0131 istedi. \u00dcretim maliyetinin \u00fczerine insanca ge\u00e7im i\u00e7in gerekli kazanc\u0131n eklenerek taban fiyat ilan edilmesi gerekti\u011fini belirten \u00d6zel, taban fiyat\u0131n alt\u0131nda al\u0131m yap\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n\u00fcne ge\u00e7ilmesini savundu.\r\n\r\n\u00d6zel, zeytin ve zeytinya\u011f\u0131n\u0131n d\u00fcnya markas\u0131 haline getirilmesi ve \u00fcreticilerin gelirinin art\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini s\u00f6yleyerek konu\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 tamamlad\u0131.","description":"\u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel, Edremit\u2019te zeytin \u00fcreticileriyle bulu\u015ftu; dane zeytine 20, zeytinya\u011f\u0131na 50 lira do\u011frudan destek \u00f6nerdi.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/habereksprescomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/haberekspres-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ozgur-ozel-balikesirde-zeytin-ureticisiyle-bulustu-antik-caglardan-beri-ilk-kez-zeytin-ureticisi-bu-csers9-n1.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"\u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel\u2019den zeytin \u00fcreticisine destek \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Haber Ekspres","image":"https:\/\/habereksprescomtr.teimg.com\/haberekspres-com-tr\/uploads\/2023\/12\/h-elogo-1.jpg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/habereksprescomtr.teimg.com\/haberekspres-com-tr\/uploads\/2023\/12\/h-elogo-1.jpg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Haber Merkezi","url":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Geylani Kilmen","url":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr\/muhabir\/101\/geylani-kilmen"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Haber Ekspres","url":"https:\/\/www.haberekspres.com.tr"}}</script>
